==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|it|ravioli}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|əʊli}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{plural of|en|raviolo}}
# Small [[square]] [[parcel]]s of [[pasta]] filled with [[meat]], [[cheese]], [[spinach]] etc.
# A [[dish]] made with ravioli.
# {{lb|en|informal}} by analogy, similar dishes/pastas from non-Italian cuisines.

